---
// Footer in Rebus editorial design style
---

<footer class="border-t-2 border-[#141413] bg-[#fbf9f5] py-12 text-xs text-[#5c5b56]">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-8">
    
    <!-- Main Footer Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 font-bold text-sm text-[#141413] mb-3 uppercase tracking-tight">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 border border-[#141413] bg-[#141413] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold">
            CMV
          </div>
          <span>Clone My Voice</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#5c5b56]">
          Fast, simple, and free speech and voice generation. Create natural voices in seconds.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-[#141413] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Navigation
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold">
          <li>
            <a href="#workbench" class="hover:text-[#141413] transition-colors">
              Studio
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#features" class="hover:text-[#141413] transition-colors">
              Features
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#141413] transition-colors">
              FAQ
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-[#141413] mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Responsible Use
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#5c5b56]">
          Use responsibly. Voice cloning requires explicit permission from the speaker. Impersonation and deceptive audio are strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Line -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#e5e0d4] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs gap-2 font-medium">
      <p>© 2026 Clone My Voice. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p class="text-[#5c5b56]">
        Simple, instant, and free voice tools.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
